  "key_boundaries": [
    "TurnEngine is a thin async-generator adapter; it does not build context or persist",
    "ChatOrchestrator dispatches context.active_capability or chat; semantic auto-routing is upstream",
    "Capability.run emits events; AgentLoop/pipeline owns model and tool calls",
    "The inner StreamBus does not provide durable turn replay; outer runtime assigns canonical seq and persists",
    "CAPABILITY_COMPLETE is not a database or host-publication receipt",
    "Closing the orchestrator generator cancels its capability task; merely disconnecting a client subscription does not mean cancelling the durable turn",
